{"game": "escape-from-duckov", "language": "english", "appid": 3167020, "month": "2026-02", "window": 4, "start_date": 1771718400, "end_date": 1772323199, "month_true_total": 375, "quota": 11, "returned": 11, "pulled_at": "2026-09-26 01:37:52 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "219462898", "author": {"steamid": "76561199684091008", "personaname": "sp00n the merry magician", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199684091008/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 1243, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 792, "last_played": 1772328347, "avatar": "1fa48f3adeb9594213eb5579244b70f7430ff46e"}, "language": "english", "review": "it hecka fun", "timestamp_created": 1772301292, "timestamp_updated": 1772301292, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1760598013", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "219459669", "author": {"steamid": "76561198310947290", "personaname": "Triple20", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198310947290/", "num_games_owned": 26, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 4509, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4330, "last_played": 1784388267, "avatar": "7c179d9873aab1f17fdc16aadcc9d96239748d6d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Over 3k hours poured into tarkov and ending wipes with Kappa-tracksuit (Pre-lightkeeper), I found my life moving on  and away from the grind. Unable to keep up with the high demand of hours, I gave it up. \n\nBut the itch remains...\n\nThat's when Escape from Duckov got on my radar. At first, it sounded like a joke and I did put it on the backburner for a month or two, but my curiosity eventually got the better of me, and I gave it a shot. To my surprise, Duckov offers something far more engaging than I anticipated.\n\nThe progression is where Escape from Duckov really gets a grip on you. The game is designed to keep you on track without needing a wiki. The way Duckov weaves its narrative and progression through notes and quests is straightforward yet un-intrusive, It points you to a direction clear enough so that you won't get lost but vague enough that you still have to pay attention and keep the brain on.\n\nAlas, Duckov is something you really need to experience for yourself without spoilers. So, if you’re someone who enjoys progression without the time drain found in Rust or Tarkov, Duckov might just be what you’re looking for.", "timestamp_created": 1772299072, "timestamp_updated": 1772299072, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1760598013", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "219446286", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970647978", "personaname": "16X", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ph4ge/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 89, "playtime_forever": 1337, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1073, "deck_playtime_at_review": 14, "last_played": 1774792774, "avatar": "b7a76e5fdeac4747943480af21abb18722bcc9b7"}, "language": "english", "review": "yep good", "timestamp_created": 1772289745, "timestamp_updated": 1772289745, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1760598013", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "219444786", "author": {"steamid": "76561198827502886", "personaname": "JD", "persona_status": "online", 